{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KugVCM8ibnMJu9LjeWYdYf","type":"tool_result","content":"660\t\n661\t(def ^:private holder-config-keys\n662\t  \"The keys a holder/source config may carry: the checkpoint (bytes and\n663\t   address), the source's machine, the arbitration decision\n664\t   (arbitration-of's, never the caller's), the protection declaration,\n665\t   the receiving machine, the receiver's own attach/observe/serve seams,\n666\t   an optional renewal-interval override, and an optional :inbound stream\n667\t   (consumed by holder-media, not passed to the driver).  Every other key\n668\t   -- :journal, :reply-inbox, :outcome-inbox, :read-ledger!,\n669\t   :append-request!, :append-diagnostic!, :clock, :store, :medium, :me,\n670\t   :units, :source-index, :enroll!, :journals -- is a composition seam,\n671\t   refused at add-holder, never overridable by a holder config.\"\n672\t  [:bytes :address :machine :arbitration :protection :receiver\n673\t   :attach! :observe! :serve! :renewal-interval :inbound])\n674\t\n675\t\n676\t(defn- check-holder-config-keys!\n677\t  \"Refuse a holder config that carries a key outside holder-config-keys:\n678\t   each such key is a composition seam the holder may not supply.\"\n679\t  [h config]\n680\t  (let [allowed (set holder-config-keys)]\n681\t    (doseq [k (keys config)]\n682\t      (check! (contains? allowed k)\n683\t              (str \"a holder config of only the documented holder keys; \"\n684\t                   (pr-str k) \" is a composition seam\")\n685\t              {:holder h :key k}))))\n686\t\n687\t\n688\t(defn- driver-config\n689\t  \"The landed driver's config for holder `h`: the composition's seams and\n690\t   media, then the holder's own keys from `config` (holder-config-keys\n691\t   less :inbound) -- a holder config cannot substitute a composition seam,\n692\t   because add-holder refuses any key outside holder-config-keys first.\"\n693\t  [c h media config]\n694\t