{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FbA2rVHsRRrWJ6FRpy25y1","type":"tool_result","content":"1436\t\n1437\t**Amended after 6c (2026-10-13), closures and continuations in the free\n1438\tenvironment on the native lanes (R3).** A de Bruijn kernel resolves free\n1439\tnames through its single `free-env` while a canonical closure snapshots\n1440\tits `env`; a closure or continuation held in the free environment\n1441\ttherefore has no finite canonical form on a de Bruijn kernel. Until\n1442\tphase 8, a de Bruijn receiver refuses such a value in the carried\n1443\t`free-env` before attach (`:yin.k/unsupported :free-env-value`, with the\n1444\tpath), and a de Bruijn source refuses it at lift before serving. The\n1445\tcarrier and the semantic-register kernel admit it. *What the code does:*"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24e59ef2-1e11-40bc-bf74-9b03c65bd1ca","uuid":"41ea9a68-34e2-42ed-891a-8276a21cba72","timestamp":"2026-10-13T18:47:57.446Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7e/docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md","content":"\n**Amended after 6c (2026-10-13), closures and continuations in the free\nenvironment on the native lanes (R3).** A de Bruijn kernel resolves free\nnames through its single `free-env` while a canonical closure snapshots\nits `env`; a closure or continuation held in the free environment\ntherefore has no finite canonical form on a de Bruijn kernel. Until\nphase 8, a de Bruijn receiver refuses such a value in the carried\n`free-env` before attach (`:yin.k/unsupported :free-env-value`, with the\npath), and a de Bruijn source refuses it at lift before serving. The\ncarrier and the semantic-register kernel admit it. *What the code does:*","numLines":10,"startLine":1436,"totalLines":2716}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FbA2rVHsRRrWJ6FRpy25y1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
